    {
      "index": 0,
      "offset": 992,
      "span_bytes": 20,
      "hex": "b7e6a7c6b2fab5b7a142a5eca8bda677a143",
      "text": "瑟希莉絲、伊里安。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "offset": 1012,
      "span_bytes": 34,
      "hex": "a641b8f2a741adccbd54bb7ba440a6b8b36fa6b8aabaa740bed4a5d8aabaa143",
      "text": "再跟你們確認一次這次的作戰目的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "offset": 1046,
      "span_bytes": 40,
      "hex": "ad6ea7e4a558a8baa8c7a477b867a5a2a568bb61c2c5a5fabdf7aabab874aacca4a7ac75a143",
      "text": "要找出那些已經失去蒼藍光輝的聖者之泉。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "offset": 1086,
      "span_bytes": 10,
      "hex": "a14ba14ba14ba14b",
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "offset": 1096,
      "span_bytes": 18,
      "hex": "a751a5ceb36fb8ccaabaa661a7cea141",
      "text": "利用這裡的地形，"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "offset": 1114,
      "span_bytes": 40,
      "hex": "a670aa47afe0b0f7c4e8b7c0a175ab6da5f1bdafa9b5a6d3a8d3a4a7aaaba176aabab8dca141",
      "text": "如果能夠殲滅「匍伏蔓延而來之物」的話，"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "offset": 1154,
      "span_bytes": 16,
      "hex": "b7edb54dac4fb3cca66eaabaa143",
      "text": "當然是最好的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "offset": 1170,
      "span_bytes": 10,
      "hex": "a14ba14ba14ba14b",
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "offset": 1180,
      "span_bytes": 8,
      "hex": "abdca66ea143",
      "text": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "offset": 1188,
      "span_bytes": 18,
      "hex": "a8babbf2a141b44eb67da96ca761a143",
      "text": "那麼，就開始吧。"
    }
  ],
